{
  "job_B2.1.2_20251003_114458": {
    "text": "Egressus Iesus de templo ibat, et accesserunt discipuli eius ut ostenderent ei \u00e6dificationem templi.\nIpse autem respondens dixit eis: Amen dico uobis, non relinquetur hic lapis super lapidem, qui non\nSedente autem eo super Montem Oliueti accesserunt ad eum discipuli secreto dicentes: Dic nobis,\nEt respondens Iesus dixit eis: Uidete ne quis uos seducat.\nMulti enim uenient in nomine meo dicentes: Ego sum Cristus; et multos seducent.\nAudituri autem estis prelia et oppiniones preliorum. Uidete ne turbemini; oportet enim hec fieri, sed\nConsurget enim gens in gentem et regnum in regnum, et erunt pestilentie et fames et terre motus per\nHec autem omnia initia sunt dolorum.\nTunc tradent uos in tribulationem et occident uos, et eritis odio omnibus gentibus propter nomen\nEt tunc scandalizabuntur multi et inuicem tradent et odio habebunt inuicem.\nEt multi pseudoprophete surgent et seducent multos.\nEt quoniam habundabit iniquitas refrigescet caritas multorum.\nQui autem permanserit usque in finem, hic saluus erit.\nEt predicabitur hoc euangelium in uniuerso orbe in testimonium omnibus gentibus; et tunc ueniet\nUerumptamen diem illam et horam nemo scit, neque angeli celorum nisi Pater solus.\nQuapropter uigilate, quia nescitis qua hora Dominus uester uenturus sit.\nLeofan men, hit gewear\u00f0 hwilum on \u00f0\u00e6re byrig \u00fee is genamod Hierusalem, \u00fe\u00e6t ures Drihtnes \u00feegnas\n\u00d0a s\u00e6de he heom \u00fe\u00e6t his sceolde weor\u00f0an \u00e6ghwylc stan on uferan dagum grundlinga toworpen.\nAnd \u00f0a agunnan hi hine eft acsian dihlice hw\u00e6nne \u00fe\u00e6t geweor\u00f0an sceolde, & eac be hwylcum tacne\n\u00d0a andwyrde he heom & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hy \u00f0earfe ahtan \u00fe\u00e6t hi w\u00e6re wurdan \u00fe\u00e6t hy \u00e6nig man to swicollice\nFor\u00f0am, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6nig wyr\u00f0 \u00fee gyt cime\u00f0 on uferan tidan \u00fee leaslice leoge\u00f0 & egeslice gylpe\u00f0,\nAnd he s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t mycle gewin scoldan geweor\u00f0an \u00e6r \u00f0am ende wide on worulde, & l\u00e6rde \u00feeah \u00fe\u00e6t\nHe s\u00e6de eac \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feeoda hetelice sceoldan winnan heom betweonan, & fela eor\u00f0styrunga & earfo\u00f0nessa\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t beo\u00f0 \u00fea angin, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00feara sarnessa \u00fee mannum beo\u00f0 towerd.\n\u00d0\u00e6t bi\u00f0 witodlice \u00fe\u00e6t he m\u00e6nde we witan ful georne \u00fea sorga & \u00f0a sarnessa \u00fee on woruld becuma\u00f0\nFor\u00f0am \u00feonne wyr\u00f0 ehtnes grimlic & sorhlic cristenes folces, & \u00e6ghwar beo\u00f0 la\u00f0e & to ands\u00e6te \u00fea \u00f0e\nAnd swiciende licceteras \u00feonne arisa\u00f0 & br\u00e6da\u00f0 to swy\u00f0e & \u00f0urh unlare forl\u00e6ra\u00f0 to manege.\nAc wel \u00feam sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00e6fre to worulde \u00fee \u00feonne ne awaca\u00f0 on \u00e6nige wisan.\nAnd an \u00feing ic eow secge gyt to gewisse, \u00fe\u00e6t witod sceal geweor\u00f0an godspel gecy\u00feed geond ealle\nAnd swa\u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere nis se man on eor\u00f0an ne se encgel on heofonan \u00fee wite \u00fe\u00e6ne andagan butan\nAnd \u00f0y man sceal wacigean & warnian symle \u00fe\u00e6t man geara weor\u00f0e huru to \u00f0am dome, weald hw\u00e6nne\nAnd on \u00feam dome, \u00fee ealle men to sculan, ure Drihten sylf eowa\u00f0 us sona his blodigan sidan & his\nLeofan men, utan beon \u00fee w\u00e6rran & don swa us \u00feearf is, lufian God ofer ealle o\u00f0re \u00feing & his willan\n\u00deonne geleana\u00f0 he hit us swa us leofast bi\u00f0.\nHim sy lof & wuldor aa butan ende, amen.",
